    "features": [
      "High-quality 12 Gauge Wire: AIMIXUN 12 AWG electrical wire with spool and have 2 Conductor Parallel Wire, Black and Red each color 100FT. The spool allows the wire to be easily cut and stored for greater convenience when in use. The jacket material is flexible and environmental friendly PVC, which can be twisted and extended it freely as you like. 12 gauge stranded wire only need 0.3 US dollars per feet, which can save you more money and give you a better life.",
      "Premium Conductor: High-quality PVC shell which make 12 gauge wire automotive more durable and eco-friendly. high temperature resistance 70 C°, low temperature resistance in extreme cold -20 C°. Good conductivity, high mechanical strengthfeatures, flame retardant, anti-aging, acid and alkali resistance and dampproof.",
      "Advantage of Copper Clad Aluminum: CCA wire costs much less, yet enjoys the same functionality and reliability as copper wire, and is a better conductor of choice for the home. The advantage of the CCA wire is lighter and more flexible than copper wire. Copper-plated aluminum is a more economical choice for power or ground wires, and is a good power conductor. Choosing this 12 AWG wire helps you save on additional installation costs.",
      "Easy Use: 12 gauge wire automotive wire is wound on a hard plastic spool and easy to cut, Red and black cable 12V can be easily stripped and cut to any length as required. Electrical Wire 2 jacket colors facilitate polarity identification, aid in installation,avoid hazards that could seriously damage your equipment with the wrong polarity. 100FT 12 awg electrical wire, A good choice for your led wirelamp wire auto wireship wire RV wiremarine wire",
      "Widely Use: AIMIXUN 12 gauge wire is widely used for various DC electrical hookups, low voltage cables, 12V DC, 24V DC, low-loss in-home. For all single color LED strip light, low voltage single color led strip, light bulb, lamp, transformer, lamps,CB Radios and motor led wire connection and other low voltage products connection. The warranty period is one year, please feel free to contact us if you have any questions after purchase, we will solve the problem for you within 24 hours!"
    ],
